  "ruleText": "Pes 505.01 Use Along Public Road Rights-of-Way. The use of herbicide on rights-of-way shall be conducted under the supervision of a certified applicator in a manner that minimizes the extent and duration of browning foliage, such as the use of herbicides or herbicide additives designed to control discoloring.\n\nSource. #150, eff 1-9-74; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96, EXPIRED: 5-30-04\n\nNew. #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #9712-B, eff 5-11-10; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #12756, eff 4-10-19; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
